        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Logistics/DC manage detention and accessorial at DC/store docks (links to VS-04/W585): dock-appointment discipline to avoid carrier detention (layover, waiting time), loading/unloading turnaround, and accessorial (lumper, reefer, hazmat handling links to VS-24.3); document and dispute unjustified charges
Responsible (R): Logistics / DC / Carrier
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3509_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3509_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3509_Task6" name="Logistics/AP manage accessorial cost: capture demurrage/detention/accessorial…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Logistics/AP manage accessorial cost: capture demurrage/detention/accessorial on the freight invoice (W3513), validate vs contract (W3499) and root cause, dispute unjustified charges (links to VS-90), and feed root-cause/accessorial analytics (W3516) and carrier scorecard (W3512); drive reduction (W3518)
Responsible (R): Logistics / AP
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager / Finance
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3509_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3509_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
