Volume: Inter-island / inter-region freight
Owner: Logistics
Participants: Logistics (links to VS-06/W66), Supply Planning (links to VS-02/VS-05.2), DC Operations (links to VS-04), Shipping Line/RORO/Forwarder, Customs (links to VS-87 where applicable)
