      <bpmn:userTask id="W3510_Task4" name="Logistics/Supply Planning coordinate inter-island/inter-region freight (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Logistics/Supply Planning coordinate inter-island/inter-region freight (links to W66/W1164): plan DC-to-DC transfers (links to VS-05.2) and DC-to-island-store replenishment across Luzon/Visayas/Mindanao, select mode (RORO, inter-island vessel, truck-ferry, air for urgent), and manage the longer transit/lead times (links to VS-02)
Responsible (R): Logistics / Supply Planning
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3510_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3510_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
