    <bpmn:process id="W_W3512" name="W3512. Carrier Performance Scorecard &amp; Quarterly Business Review" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly cycle; QBR cadence
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly QBR
Volume: Carrier/3PL base
Owner: Logistics / Procurement
Participants: Logistics (links to VS-06/VS-56), Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-67), DC (links to VS-04), Store (links to VS-07), FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), Carrier/3PL
Source: workflow W3512 — Carrier Performance Scorecard &amp; Quarterly Business Review</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3512_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3512_Lane1" name="Logistics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3512_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3512_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3512_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3512_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3512_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3512_Start3" name="Monthly cycle; QBR cadence">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3512_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3512_Task4" name="Logistics/BI compute the carrier/3PL scorecard per leg: on-time…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Logistics/BI compute the carrier/3PL scorecard per leg: on-time pickup/delivery, transit adherence, damage/loss/claims rate (W3511), invoice accuracy (W3513), cost/rate compliance (W3499), routing-guide compliance (W3500), capacity responsiveness, and HSE/safety (links to VS-24); benchmark carriers (links to VS-67 methodology)
Responsible (R): Logistics / BI
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3512_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3512_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3512_Task5" name="Logistics/Procurement conduct the quarterly business review (QBR) with each…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Logistics/Procurement conduct the quarterly business review (QBR) with each core carrier/3PL (links to W1439/VS-56): performance vs SLA/contract, scorecard, root cause of issues, capacity/rate outlook, continuous-improvement actions, and relationship/strategy; manage consequences (growth, probation, exit)
Responsible (R): Logistics / Procurement / Carrier
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3512_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3512_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3512_Task6" name="Logistics/Procurement feed QBR outcomes to the carrier-base strategy (W3497)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Logistics/Procurement feed QBR outcomes to the carrier-base strategy (W3497), sourcing (W3498), contract renewal (W3499), routing guide (W3500), and program governance (W3520); publish the carrier scorecard to procurement/vendor management (links to VS-03/VS-67)
Responsible (R): Logistics / Procurement
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3512_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3512_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3512_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3512_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3512_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-560 (ensure controlled execution — Freight Execution, Routing Guide &amp; Visibility (PA-110.2).) | - operational: data discipline and carrier validation; operational: consequence management at QBR
Owner: Logistics / Procurement</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
